      "document_id": "1043",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "Senator DeWine claims credit for securing a $78,046 federal grant for the Troy Township Fire Department in Ohio. He explicitly links this funding to his authorship and passage of the FIRE Act, as well as his work on the Appropriations Committee to secure funding for the program, which aligns with inclusion criteria (1)."
